    "Calendars on an ncad.ie account are proposed as college. College events stay on your devices: they are never sent to Claude, synced or shown in notifications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Çáléñdárs óñ áñ ñçád.íé áççóúñt áré própóséd ás çóllégé. Çóllégé évéñts stáý óñ ýóúr dévíçés: théý áré ñévér séñt tó Çláúdé, sýñçéd ór shówñ íñ ñótífíçátíóñs. ·······························································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
