    "Each brief arrives at the first natural break after its time: the end of an event, a free gap of 15 minutes or opening Eagar. It is never more than 45 minutes late.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éáçh bríéf árrívés át thé fírst ñátúrál bréák áftér íts tímé: thé éñd óf áñ évéñt, á fréé gáp óf 15 míñútés ór ópéñíñg Éágár. Ít ís ñévér móré tháñ 45 míñútés láté. ··································································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
